{"seq":1,"slug":"tools-of-modern-physics","title":"现代物理的通用工具","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-physics/tools-of-modern-physics","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"现代物理的通用工具\">现代物理的通用工具</h1><p>理查德·费曼对物理学最持久的影响，不是某一条具体定律，而是两件<strong>思维工具</strong>——费曼图与路径积分。它们诞生于 1948 年前后为解决量子电动力学（QED）发散难题而做的努力，却在随后数十年里逸出 QED，渗入凝聚态、统计力学、宇宙学乃至金融工程，成为整个理论物理的&quot;通用语言&quot;。本篇追踪这两件工具<strong>如何</strong>从被冷遇走向普及、<strong>为何</strong>具有跨领域的可移植性，以及它们各自的边界与被滥用的方式。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>工具的&quot;发明&quot;细节属兄弟卷，本篇只讲&quot;传播与影响&quot;。费曼图的画法与规则见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">../../2_core-contributions/1_qed-and-diagrams/1_feynman-diagrams.md</a>，路径积分的构造见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/qed-and-diagrams/the-path-integral-formulation\">../../2_core-contributions/1_qed-and-diagrams/2_the-path-integral-formulation.md</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>费曼最持久的影响不是某条具体定律，而是两件<strong>思维工具</strong>——费曼图与路径积分。理解它们的影响力，关键在一条判据：<strong>一项贡献的影响半径，取决于它被重新表述的成本</strong>。费曼图与路径积分的成本极低——任何掌握微扰论的人都能在新系统上重画一遍，因而它们的影响半径覆盖了大半个理论物理，从凝聚态、统计力学一直渗到宇宙学乃至金融工程。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提炼的是结构而非技巧</strong>：费曼没有止步于解一个 QED 难题，而是提炼出与具体哈密顿量无关的结构——「对可能性求和」与「逐项画图」，在任何有量子叠加或统计涨落的系统里都成立。</li>\n<li><strong>两者互相支撑</strong>：路径积分是费曼图的理论根基，费曼图则是路径积分微扰展开的记账法。</li>\n<li><strong>可移植性的数学根源</strong>：把时间做维克转动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\to -i\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，相位因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{iS/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成实指数权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-S_E/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同一套形式直接变成统计力学的配分函数。</li>\n<li><strong>边界</strong>：工具强大也容易被误当成实在——虚粒子不是真实传播的粒子，强耦合区不能盲用微扰展开，微扰级数实为渐近级数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"从冷遇到普及-一段非自动的历史\">从冷遇到普及：一段非自动的历史</h2><p>费曼图并非一问世就被接受。1948 年 3 月 30 日至 4 月 2 日的波科诺会议（Pocono Conference，宾州，28 位物理学家与会，含奥本海默、玻尔、狄拉克）上，费曼首次展示这套图示，反应<strong>冷淡</strong>——因为它建立在直觉论证之上，缺乏当时尚不存在的数学根基（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pocono_Conference\">Pocono Conference, Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p>真正完成&quot;翻译&quot;工作的是弗里曼·戴森（Freeman Dyson）。1948 年夏，戴森同时深谈过费曼的图示法与施温格（Julian Schwinger）的非图示重整化，在 1949 年的论文《Tomonaga、Schwinger 与 Feynman 的辐射理论》中证明三套方法等价，并从 QED 推导出费曼图规则的数学基础。施温格后来评价费曼图&quot;把计算带给了大众&quot;（brought computation to the masses，<a href=\"https://inpp.ohio.edu/~rochej/group_page/documents/references/Feynman_Diagrams_American_Scientist.pdf\">American Scientist</a>）。这段历史的教训是：<strong>一件工具的普及不靠发明者的天才，而靠它能否被他人重新表述、嫁接进既有体系。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title 费曼图从直觉到通用语言&#10;    1948 : 波科诺会议首次展示 : 反应冷淡(缺数学根基)&#10;    1949 : 戴森证明三套方法等价 : 推导出图规则&#10;    1950s : 进入 QED 标准计算流程&#10;    1960s : 移植到多体问题与引力计算&#10;    今天 : 粒子物理学家的&quot;母语&quot;\">timeline\n    title 费曼图从直觉到通用语言\n    1948 : 波科诺会议首次展示 : 反应冷淡(缺数学根基)\n    1949 : 戴森证明三套方法等价 : 推导出图规则\n    1950s : 进入 QED 标准计算流程\n    1960s : 移植到多体问题与引力计算\n    今天 : 粒子物理学家的\"母语\"</pre><h2 id=\"两件工具的分工与可移植性\">两件工具的分工与可移植性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>数学内核</th>\n<th>解决的核心问题</th>\n<th>跨领域落点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>费曼图</td>\n<td>微扰展开的逐项可视化</td>\n<td>把高阶积分项变成可枚举的拓扑图</td>\n<td>弱/强相互作用、凝聚态多体、引力微扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径积分</td>\n<td>对所有路径求和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mtext>paths</mtext></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{\\text{paths}} e^{iS/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3238em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paths</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>量子振幅的几何化表述</td>\n<td>量子场论、统计力学、弦论、期权定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两者并非独立：路径积分是费曼图的<strong>理论根基</strong>，费曼图则是路径积分微扰展开的<strong>记账法</strong>。它们之所以可移植，关键在于费曼没有止步于解一个 QED 难题，而是提炼出与具体哈密顿量无关的<strong>结构</strong>——&quot;对可能性求和&quot;与&quot;逐项画图&quot;这两种结构，在任何有量子叠加或统计涨落的系统里都成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路径积分的核心式与跨域复用\">路径积分的核心式与跨域复用</h2><p>路径积分把一个粒子从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的振幅写成对所有可能路径的相位求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mfrac><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></msubsup><mi>L</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(b,a) = \\int \\mathcal{D}x(t)\\, \\exp\\!\\left(\\frac{i}{\\hbar} S[x(t)]\\right),\\quad S[x(t)] = \\int_{t_a}^{t_b} L\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℏ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5555em;vertical-align:-1.012em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5435em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.012em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把时间做&quot;维克转动&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\to -i\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，相位因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{iS/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成实指数权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-S_E/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，于是同一套形式<strong>直接</strong>变成统计力学的配分函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi><mi>ϕ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z = \\int \\mathcal{D}\\phi\\, e^{-S_E[\\phi]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这正是路径积分能从量子场论平移到临界现象、再被布莱克-斯科尔斯式金融数学借用的数学原因——&quot;对路径加权求和&quot;在不同领域只是权重函数换了名字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么工具影响比定理更持久\">为什么工具影响比定理更持久</h2><p>物理学中，具体定理会被更普遍的理论吸收或修正，但<strong>思维方式</strong>一旦塑造一代人的直觉就极难替代。费曼图让物理学家&quot;用图像思考相互作用&quot;，路径积分让他们以&quot;路径叠加&quot;理解量子。整代物理学家的计算反射，都建立在这两件工具之上——这是一种比任何单条公式都更深、更难磨灭的遗产。这种&quot;以方法塑造学科文化&quot;的影响，在 <a href=\"shaping-particle-physics\">2_shaping-particle-physics.md</a> 中以粒子物理为例继续展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-工具的边界与误用\">反模式：工具的边界与误用</h2><p>工具强大，也容易被误当成实在。常见误用有三：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>把费曼图当成物理实在</strong>。图中的内线（虚粒子）是微扰级数的记账符号，不是真实传播的粒子；把&quot;虚光子&quot;当作可探测对象是典型范畴错误（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1901.02233\">arXiv:1901.02233 关于费曼图解读</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>在强耦合区盲用微扰展开</strong>。费曼图依赖微扰级数收敛，量子色动力学（QCD）低能区耦合强、级数失效，这里要换格点方法而非堆更多图。</li>\n<li><strong>以为&quot;求和&quot;必收敛</strong>。QED 的微扰级数实为渐近级数，加到某阶后反而变差——工具有效不等于级数收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解工具的适用边界，本身就是费曼&quot;不自欺&quot;方法论的一部分，见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/intellectual-honesty/the-principle-of-not-fooling-yourself\">../../3_ideas-and-methods/2_intellectual-honesty/1_the-principle-of-not-fooling-yourself.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原创综合-工具型遗产的判据\">原创综合：工具型遗产的判据</h2><p>把费曼的工具型遗产与&quot;定理型遗产&quot;对照，可提炼一条判据：一项贡献的影响半径，取决于它<strong>被重新表述的成本</strong>。费曼图与路径积分的成本极低——任何掌握微扰论的人都能在新系统上重画一遍，因而它们的影响半径覆盖了大半个理论物理。这也解释了为何费曼在科学史上的地位，更多系于&quot;他给了同行什么工具&quot;，而非&quot;他证明了哪条定律&quot;。其历史定位的学术评价见 <a href=\"../../controversies-and-appraisal/historical-appraisal/his-place-in-history\">../../6_controversies-and-appraisal/3_historical-appraisal/2_his-place-in-history.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>费曼图与路径积分之所以成为理论物理的「通用语言」，根源是它们被重新表述的成本极低，因而能不断被移植到新系统。它们的影响力建立在提炼结构而非解决单一难题之上，维克转动更把这种可移植性显式暴露为一套能贯通量子场论与统计力学的数学形式。传播史给出的补充教训是：一件工具的普及不靠发明者的天才，而靠它能否被他人重新表述、嫁接进既有体系——戴森「翻译」费曼图的过程正是范例。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"现代物理的通用工具","id":"现代物理的通用工具"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从冷遇到普及：一段非自动的历史","id":"从冷遇到普及-一段非自动的历史"},{"level":2,"text":"两件工具的分工与可移植性","id":"两件工具的分工与可移植性"},{"level":2,"text":"路径积分的核心式与跨域复用","id":"路径积分的核心式与跨域复用"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么工具影响比定理更持久","id":"为什么工具影响比定理更持久"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：工具的边界与误用","id":"反模式-工具的边界与误用"},{"level":2,"text":"原创综合：工具型遗产的判据","id":"原创综合-工具型遗产的判据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"塑造粒子物理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-physics/shaping-particle-physics"}}